      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Using something like `Mathf.Log10()` to set the volume would probably fix the issue.\nNot saying it's a one-line fix, but I'm very certain the bug would be worth fixing. Especially with how many music events VRChat has nowadays.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
