      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "... The new UI made this problem a fair bit worse!! 😣\nWe no longer have numbers for the audio sliders. Which would be fine, if this bug didn't exist!\nThe difference between 80% volume and 100% is HUGE (almost 2x quieter), and the new UI doesn't represent that at all.",
